{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20793","headline":"感古四首 四 · 卢仝","name":"感古四首 四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"君莫以富贵，轻忽他年少。\n听我暂话会稽朱太守，正受冻饿时。\n索得人家贵傲妇，读书书史未润身。\n负薪辛苦胝生肘，谓言琴与瑟。\n糟糠结长久，不分杀人羽翮成。\n临临冲天妇嫌丑，□□□□□□□。\n其奈一朝太守振羽仪，乡关昼行衣锦衣。\n哀哉旧妇何眉目，新壻随行向天哭。\n寸心金石徒尔爲，杯水庭沙空自覆。\n乃知愚妇人，妬忌阴毒心。\n唯救眼底事，不思日月深。\n等闲取羞死，岂如甘布衾。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢仝","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20793.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20793","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}